<title>CANADA: Canadian Utilities places C$60 mln pfds.</title>
<headline>Canadian Utilities places C$60 mln pfds.</headline>
<dateline>EDMONTON 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Utilities Limited said on Thursday it will issue on a private placement basis C$60 million of shares.</p>
<p>The company said it will issue C$40 million of perpetual cumulative second preffered shares series T at C$25 each to close on December 2, 1996 and C$20 million of series U at $25 each to close on November 26, 1996.  Both issues are to yield 4.63 percent.</p>
<p>The issues are subject to regulatory approval, Canadian Utilities said.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
